<view class="page"><view class="brand">ADC 口腔</view><view class="title">确认网站登录</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{ticket}}" class="card"><view>你正在授权电脑浏览器登录：</view><view class="destination" selectable="true">{{ticket.origin}}</view><view>登录码有效至 {{expiresLabel}}</view><view class="muted">只确认你本人刚刚打开的网站。微信确认不会建立病历或授予员工权限。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="approve" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||ticket.state!=='PENDING'}}">确认登录此网站</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="reject" disabled="{{busy||ticket.state!=='PENDING'}}">拒绝本次登录</button><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice" role="status">{{notice}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{!notice}}" bindtap="switchAccount" disabled="{{busy}}">更换微信登录账号</button><navigator class="link" url="/pages/discovery/index" open-type="reLaunch">返回门店首页</navigator></view>
